{"step_index":59,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T04:53:56Z","input_tokens":16554,"cache_read_tokens":236987,"output_tokens":781,"content":"I've started the swarm with what I found in the review. Nothing is fixed yet; the workers will report back on the board.\n\n**Most serious problem:** the current files in `LATEST/` (env, anim and clay) are broken. 441 of the 672 track objects (ad boards, stand parts, garage, bridges, big screens and so on) have been moved to the world origin (0,0,0).\n- **Cause:** the cleanup step added to [v5_env.py](file:///d:/项目session/blender-supercar/pipeline/v5_env.py#L1059-L1072) on 11/17 re-centres objects before their positions are updated.\n- **Effect:** the clay video `f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4` is wrong because of this. The colour film was rendered on 11/14, before the bug, so it is fine.\n\n**Redundant or broken models:**\n- The fence posts are all zero-area faces, so they never show up in renders.\n- 11 of the 12 floodlight masts (the field masts) have no pole, only a lamp head floating in the air.\n- 18 duplicate brake-board pole objects sit exactly on top of each other.\n- About 172 tiny 0.16 m truss cubes on the stands are invisible at normal distance.\n- 60 separate pit-box line objects can be one mesh.\n- There are empty collections and duplicated code in `v5_anim.py`.\n\n**How the swarm splits the work:**\n\n| Worker | Owns |\n|---|---|\n| `env` | `v5_env.py` and `v5_anim.py`: fix the bugs, merge the redundant pieces, and give each stand, bridge, screen and similar group an Empty parent so you can move a whole group at once. Then rebuild, render test stills, and re-render the clay version. |\n| `verifier` | Checks that positions, editability and the look are unchanged. It reports problems but doesn't edit files. |\n| `tidy` | Updates the docs and writes an editing guide. Once the rebuild passes, it deletes the redundant model files: the `.blend1` backups and the stale `v5_stage_env.blend` copy in `_unrelated`. |\n| `monitor` | Steps in only if the swarm stalls. |\n\nThe colour film won't be re-rendered (about 30 min) unless you ask for it.\n\n[Open the Swarm UI](sidecar://swarm/swarm_board/)"}
